Package: nethist
Type: Package
Title: Network histogram 
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2024-11-15
Authors@R: c(person("Youngseok","Song", email="youngseok.song@mail.wvu.edu", role =c("aut", "cre")), 
            person("Sofia C.","Olhede", email = "sofia.olhede@epfl.ch", role = "aut"))
Maintainer: Youngseok Song <youngseok.song@mail.wvu.edu>
Description: R package for network histogram estimation and additional tools. To install the package from source, you need C++ and Fortran (due to RSpectra) compilers. We suggest you to use undirected and simple graphs (either igraph or matrix) as inputs for the functions in this package.
